# Chemical Process Surrogate Project

This repository is organized around one canonical package, one scripts folder, and one configs folder.

## Canonical Directory Layout

- `src/process_graph/`: core library package (models, parser, resolver, dataset, experiment config loaders)
- `scripts/`: runnable entry scripts only
- `configs/`: runtime configuration files (`experiment`, `model`, `data`, `train`, `overrides`)
- `data/`: input datasets/specs
- `outputs/`: training/debug artifacts

## Script Naming Convention

- Main training: `scripts/train_surrogate.py` (alias to `scripts/train_process_surrogate.py`)
- Root shortcut entry: `train.py` (delegates to main training script)
- Dataset prep: `scripts/prepare_datasets_v2.py`, `scripts/prepare_single_process.py` (alias to `scripts/prepare_single_process_dataset.py`)
- Spec parsing/smoke checks: `scripts/parse_all_process_specs.py`, `scripts/debug_readout_nodes.py` (alias to `scripts/smoke_readout_nodes.py`)
- Target-only diagnostics: `scripts/target_only_debug/train_target_only.py`

## Config Naming Convention

- Base experiment: `configs/experiment/process_surrogate_base.yaml`
- Model: `configs/model/process_encoder.yaml`
- Data: `configs/data/process_data.yaml`
- Train: `configs/train/process_train.yaml`
- Debug overrides: `configs/overrides/`

## Notes

- Keep reusable code under `src/process_graph/`; avoid adding logic directly into scripts.
- Keep one script = one entry purpose, and keep script names snake_case.
- Store generated artifacts under `outputs/` only.
